    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Exclude quashed convictions from prison confinement periods";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) For the purposes of this Act, the period during which a person is confined to a prison does not include a period during which the person has been so confined by reason only of the person serving a sentence relating to a conviction that is later quashed.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The period of confinement in prison or psychiatric institution does not include a period during which the person has been so confined by reason only of the person serving a sentence relating to a conviction that is later quashed.";
