    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Parent must be an Australian citizen.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) a parent of the person was an Australian citizen at the time of the birth;";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "The parent is an Australian citizen.";
