    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "has";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Parent must have been present in Australia for at least 2 years.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(ii) the parent has been present in Australia (except as an unlawful non-citizen) for a total period of at least 2 years at any time before the person made the application;";
