    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(4B) A person is covered by this subsection if:  (a) at the time the person made the application under section 16, the person:  (i) is not a national of any country; and  (ii) is not a citizen of any country; and  (b) at the time of the person’s birth, the person had a parent who was an Australian citizen.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(4B) A person is covered by this subsection if:  (a) at the time the person made the application under section 16, the person:  (i) is not a national of any country; and  (ii) is not a citizen of any country; and  (b) at the time of the person’s birth, the person had a parent who was an Australian citizen.";
