    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(2) However, if:  (a) the Minister makes a decision under section 24 to refuse to approve a person becoming an Australian citizen; and  (b) the Minister’s reasons for the decision did not refer to the eligibility ground in subsection 21(8) (about statelessness); a person (the applicant) cannot apply for review of that decision unless the applicant is a permanent resident.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/conclusionText> "(2) However, if:  (a) the Minister makes a decision under section 24 to refuse to approve a person becoming an Australian citizen; and  (b) the Minister’s reasons for the decision did not refer to the eligibility ground in subsection 21(8) (about statelessness); a person (the applicant) cannot apply for review of that decision unless the applicant is a permanent resident.";
